inkcut-cpp (0.4.1-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Separate plotter work area from material dimensions in model, UI, and preview.
  * Cutting-mat style work-area overlay with rulers (no internal grid).
  * Tablet Layers panel layout fixes; Material tab label and custom speed checkbox.
  * Remove duplicate material size fields from Device Setup General tab.
  * Drop legacy minimum device area (508×762 mm) inherited from HPGL defaults.

 -- pratanczuk <pratanczuk@users.noreply.github.com>  Mon, 18 May 2026 12:00:00 +0200

inkcut-cpp (0.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Product focus narrowed to G-code/GRBLHAL only.
  * Removed non-G-code protocol choices from UI and CLI defaults.
  * Streamlined device presets and protocol tests for G-code-only flow.

 -- pratanczuk <pratanczuk@users.noreply.github.com>  Sun, 17 May 2026 13:45:00 +0200

inkcut-cpp (0.2.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial public release of the C++/Qt6 port of Inkcut.
  * SVG, DXF (libdxfrw) and bitmap (libpotrace) import.
  * HPGL, DMPL, GPGL, G-code, CAMM output protocols.
  * EN/PL translations.

